{"id": "EUVD-2026-77461", "enisaUuid": "4d90673b-08ee-39c0-a11b-0c06f3ed1f49", "description": "Insufficiently Protected Credentials vulnerability in Apache Syncope.\n\nAudit events, when sent to the configured store, are not sufficiently masked for the sensitive values they might carry on their payloads, thus allowing administrators to access such sensitive values.\n\n\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Syncope: from 3.0.0-M0 through 3.0.16, from 4.0.0-M0 Through 4.0.7, from 4.1.0-M0 through 4.1.2.\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 4.0.8 / 4.1.3, which fix this issue.", "datePublished": "2026-09-14T12:55:27", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-14T19:26:59", "baseScore": 4.9, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N", "references": ["https://lists.apache.org/thread/nns7711kyomy28r7rh2pps06ymd5s99k"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-75015", "GHSA-p5vm-7q6r-6j5w"], "assigner": "apache", "epss": 0.39, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3d256df4-7248-3bd6-aef8-6ed198828951", "product": {"name": "Apache Syncope", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "3.0.0-M0 \u22643.0.16"}, {"id": "c602afd2-a8ac-3ac3-9872-6e8f16ff23be", "product": {"name": "Apache Syncope", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "4.1.0-M0 \u22644.1.2"}, {"id": "fb2ebee3-edde-32bb-bc7a-1de212b677f9", "product": {"name": "Apache Syncope", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "4.0.0-M0 \u22644.0.7"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "78d4222c-6207-3183-9c3d-810e8cd2c761", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}], "isExploited": false}